French fox's speciality was sex.

567
00:37:38,542 --> 00:37:42,732
- What was your speciality ?
- Knives.

568
00:37:42,859 --> 00:37:44,747
The character I played,
Raven McCoy,

569
00:37:44,811 --> 00:37:48,520
her background was she grew up
raised by circus performers.

570
00:37:48,586 --> 00:37:52,677
According to the show,
she was the deadliest woman
in the world with a knife.

571
00:37:52,747 --> 00:37:55,397
And she knew
a zillion old jokes.

572
00:37:55,467 --> 00:37:59,428
Her grandfather,
an old vaudevillian, taught her.

573
00:37:59,498 --> 00:38:02,662
And if we would have got picked up,
they would've worked in a gimmick...

574
00:38:02,730 --> 00:38:06,439
where every show
I would've told another joke.

575
00:38:07,593 --> 00:38:10,244
You know any of them old jokes ?

576
00:38:10,313 --> 00:38:13,892
Well, I only got the chance to say one
'cause we only did one show.

577
00:38:13,962 --> 00:38:16,417
- Tell me.
- It's corny.

578
00:38:17,290 --> 00:38:19,296
Don't be that way.
Tell me.

579
00:38:19,370 --> 00:38:22,915
- No, you wouldn't like it,
and I'd be embarrassed.
- You'd be embarr--

580
