599
00:40:07,879 --> 00:40:12,220
Why do we feel it's necessary
to yak about bullshit
in order to be comfortable ?

600
00:40:12,294 --> 00:40:16,069
I don't know.
That's a good question.

601
00:40:16,134 --> 00:40:20,674
That's when you know
you found somebody really special.

602
00:40:20,742 --> 00:40:25,249
When you can just shut the fuck up for
a minute and comfortably share silence.

603
00:40:25,319 --> 00:40:29,247
Well, I don't think we're quite
there yet, but don't feel bad.
We just met each other.

604
00:40:30,695 --> 00:40:33,694
I'll tell you what.

605
00:40:33,766 --> 00:40:36,897
I'm gonna go to the bathroom
and powder my nose.

606
00:40:36,966 --> 00:40:40,031
You sit here...
and think of something to say.

607
00:40:41,221 --> 00:40:43,076
I'll do that.

608
00:40:45,318 --> 00:40:47,172
Okay.

609
00:40:59,301 --> 00:41:01,244
[ Wolf Whistle ]

610
00:41:01,317 --> 00:41:03,651
[ People Applauding ]

611
00:41:08,581 --> 00:41:11,331
[ Sniffing ]

612
00:41:11,397 --> 00:41:13,502
I said goddamn !

613
00:41:13,573 --> 00:41:16,606
Goddamn !
Goddamn.

614
00:41:19,109 --> 00:41:21,597
