That is Mamie Van Doren.

624
00:41:49,924 --> 00:41:54,658
I don't see Jayne Mansfield,
so she must have the night off.

625
00:41:54,723 --> 00:41:58,020
- Pretty smart.
- Yeah. I got my moments.

626
00:41:58,084 --> 00:42:02,274
- So did you think of somethin' to say ?
- Actually, I did.

627
00:42:03,844 --> 00:42:05,730
However...

628
00:42:07,363 --> 00:42:10,266
you seem like
a really nice person, and l--

629
00:42:10,340 --> 00:42:13,057
- I don't want to offend you.
