- And-- And nothin'.

658
00:43:47,777 --> 00:43:50,526
That's it.

659
00:43:50,591 --> 00:43:52,566
You heard Marsellus...

660
00:43:52,640 --> 00:43:56,830
threw Tony Rocky Horror
out of a fourth-story window
for giving me a foot massage ?

661
00:43:56,896 --> 00:43:58,750
- Mm-hmm.
- And you believe that ?

662
00:43:58,816 --> 00:44:03,158
[ Chuckles ] Well, at the time
I was told it sounded reasonable.

663
